#__________API TOKENS FROM REDCAP (Stage 1)__________
# To request a token:
# 1. Log in into REDCap and click the project on which you want to request a token.
# 2. Make sure that your user rights have "API Export" enabled. If not, close REDCap, contact a team member to update your permissions and repeat step 1.
# 3. Once in the project, locate the "Applications" section on the left side and click "API".
# 4. Click on "Request API token".
# 5. Once approved by a REDCap admin, you will receive an email confirmation that your token was created.
# 6. To access/copy token, repeat steps 1 and 3. 
